---
description: "genOS kernel loader — ensures AGENTS.md is read on every session."
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow `genOS/AGENTS.md` (genOS is installed in the `genOS/` subfolder; kernel paths are relative to it). It defines the genOS operating system, including commands (`kickoff`, `shutdown`, `doctor`, `status`, `batch`), BOOT/SHUTDOWN protocols, and all project memory rules.
